      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JILLIBY DREAMLOVER (9) hasn't been seen since she copped a check and broke in the Inter Dominion final in July but has been kept ticking over with a trial. She won her other two starts of the Brisbane carnival, highlighted by her Great Square victory. Draws on the back row but has a fine record here and is well placed against her own age and sex. GATESYS GEM (3) has been freshened but has trialled since her last-start third in Sydney and had scored a fresh win here prior. Another with a strong record at this venue and she gets the aid of a good draw. KEAYANG KURKI (4) led from wider and boxed on okay last start following back-to-back placings here, also from deeper draws. Two-time Group 1 winner so she is capable on her day. NO MONEY NO HONEY (2) overcame a wide barrier to win here last start and draws to be competitive. IRON WOMEN (6) hasn't raced for two months but is quite consistent and can feature with even luck.",
